-- M4 Stage A, gate PASS-M4A-FORDING.  Fording (encoding an index as a
-- uniform parameter plus equations) stays blocked: the length here is
-- declared as a second PARAMETER, and its own constructor is rejected
-- BEFORE define_ind's ctor fold ever reaches vpcons, since vpnil is
-- checked first and already fails the result-head rule (0 zero is not
-- the parameter n itself).  This is why user decision 3 admits general
-- recursive indexed families now instead of fencing them: Fording had
-- no escape route to fall back to.  See kernel test A5 for the isolated
-- vpcons-alone positivity failure this same shape triggers when vpnil
-- is not in the way.
data VecP (0 A : Type 0) (0 n : Nat) : Type 0 :=
  | vpnil : VecP A zero
  | vpcons : (0 m : Nat) -> A -> VecP A m -> VecP A (succ m)
